+# --- N.2  the ONE-UPGRADE LATENCY, pinned as intended behaviour ------------
+# MEASURED S327: `.claude/.framework-version` enters install.sh at v1.3.0
+# (`git show v1.2.0:scripts/install.sh | grep -c framework-version` = 0 vs 13
